---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../config';
---
<Doc title="Terms · Tracend" description="The terms for the Tracend website and beta waitlist.">
  <h1>Terms</h1>
  <p class="doc-date">Last updated 13 October 2026</p>
  <p class="doc-lede">These terms cover this website and the Tracend beta waitlist. The app has its own terms, shown when you first open it.</p>

  <h2>The waitlist</h2>
  <p>Joining is free. It reserves a place in line, not a guaranteed spot: we invite people in waves, and confirmed referrals can move you up. We may pause, change or close the waitlist or the beta at any time.</p>

  <h2>Who can join</h2>
  <p>You must be 18 or older, and the email must be yours. One place per person. We may remove sign-ups that use throwaway addresses, automated tools or other people&rsquo;s emails, and referrals gamed the same way.</p>

  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>Tracend gives training and nutrition guidance for healthy adults. It is not a medical service and does not diagnose or treat anything. Talk to a doctor before starting a new training or diet plan, especially if you have a health condition, an injury or are pregnant.</p>

  <h2>What this page shows</h2>
  <p>The screens and numbers on this site are examples for a made-up athlete. Some features shown are on the way and marked as coming next.</p>

  <h2>Trademarks</h2>
  <p>Apple, iPhone, Apple Watch and Apple Health are trademarks of Apple Inc. Tracend is not affiliated with Apple.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Doc>
